You are working on a Manga Reading Platform capstone project.

Read and follow ALL rules in these files (in order):
1. .ai-rules/frontend.md — Flutter frontend rules, MangaDex-inspired design, architecture
2. .ai-rules/conventions.md — Code conventions, naming, git
3. .ai-rules/project-context.md — Domain knowledge, FRs, tech stack

Key requirements:
- docs/PROJECT-REFERENCE.md is the single source of truth for all FRs, UCs, and architecture
- REF/ contains read-only reference projects — study patterns but never modify
- Frontend: Flutter with Riverpod + GoRouter + freezed + Dio
- UI: MangaDex-inspired dark theme, orange accent (#FF6740), Inter/Nunito Sans font
- Code lives in SOURCE/frontend/
- Prioritize reusable widgets in shared/widgets/
- Every async operation must handle loading, data, and error states
- Use const constructors, ListView.builder, CachedNetworkImage everywhere
